ps and other treatments.', 220000, 'IDR', 6), ('Traditional Massage', 'Traditional Full Body “Pijat” Massage (30 minutes) (30 min)', 'Calm your mind, body and spirit with our Bali traditional style massage', 80000, 'IDR', 0), ('Traditional Massage', 'Traditional Full Body “Pijat” Massage (60 minutes) (60 min)', null, 120000, 'IDR', 1), ('Traditional Massage', 'Traditional Full Body “Pijat” Massage (90 minutes) (90 min)', null, 170000, 'IDR', 2), ('Traditional Massage', 'Baby Massage (30 min)', 'Also babies and small children can enjoy a massage and get their muscles relaxed', 80000, 'IDR', 3), ('Traditional Massage', 'Hand to Elbow Massage (30 min)', null, 70000, 'IDR', 4), ('Traditional Massage', 'Money Massage “Kerokan” (30 min)', 'A coin will be dragged across the skin of the back, neck shoulders.', 70000, 'IDR', 5), ('Traditional Massage', 'Traditional Full Body “Pijat” Massage (30 min)', 'Calm your mind, body and spirit with our Bali traditional style massage.', 80000, 'IDR', 6), ('Traditional Massage', 'Baby Massage (30 min)', 'Also Babies and small children can enjoy a massage and get their muscles relaxed.', 80000, 'IDR', 7), ('Traditional Massage', 'Hand to Elbow Massage (30 min)', null, 70000, 'IDR', 8), ('Traditional Massage', 'Money Massage “Kerokan” (30 min)', 'A coin will be dragged across the skin of the back, neck shoulders to help alleviate colds, colic and weak, aching bones by expelling bad wind from the body.', 70000, 'IDR', 9), ('Head Massage', 'Head, Neck and Shoulder Massage (30 min)', null, 70000, 'IDR', 0), ('Head Massage', 'Head, Neck and Shoulder Massage (30 min)', null, 70000, 'IDR', 1), ('Reflexology', 'Foot Reflexology (60 minutes) (60 min)', 'Let our skilled reflexologist use his thumb pressure to press and deeply massage each of the tiny reflex zones in your feet.', 125000, 'IDR', 0), ('Reflexology', 'Foot Reflexology (90 minutes) (90 min)', null, 180000, 'IDR', 1), ('Reflexology', 'Foot Reflexology (60 min)', 'Let our skilled reflexologist use his thumb pressure to press and deeply massage each of the tiny reflex zones in your feed to stimulate the associated organs and glands thereby activating the body’s natural healing mechanisms and correcting imbalances.', 125000, 'IDR', 2), ('Body Scrub', 'Body Scrub', 'Treat yourself to an exfoliating scrub removing dead skin cells leaving your skin feeling soft and smooth. Select our range of essences including the famous Bali Coffee Scrub.', 210000, 'IDR', 0), ('Body Scrub', 'Body Scrub', 'Treat yourself to an exfoliating scrub removing dead skin cells leaving your skin feeling soft and smooth.', 210000, 'IDR', 1), ('Javanese Lulur', 'Traditional “Lulur”', 'Our traditional lulur is a truly pampering ritual; it comprises an aromatic massage, exfoliating body scrub and relaxing floral bath.', 490000, 'IDR', 0), ('Javanese Lulur', 'Traditional “Lulur” (180 min)', 'Our traditional lulur is a truly pampering ritual; the lulur is a treat for everyone.', 490000, 'IDR', 1)) as i(sec, name, descr, price, cur, pos) on i.sec = secs.name;

