et recipe with blends of essential oil extracts from Balinese spices and flowers, especially prepared to relax and soothe your senses. The treatment includes gentle and relaxing strokes along with vigorous pressure-point stimulations to reduce stress, relieve strained muscles, stimulate blood circulation, detoxify the body as well as nourish the skin.', 847000, 'IDR', 0), ('Traditional Massage', 'Traditional Candidasa Body Massage (60 min)', 'A full-body and powerful massage from Candidasa to release tension, realigns your sense, and calms you down. It combines aroma of the essential oils with application of some techniques including skin rolling, kneading and stroking and pressure point stimulation.', 847000, 'IDR', 1), ('Traditional Massage', 'Puri Sense Body Massage (60 min)', 'A royal village secret recipe with blends of essential oil extracts from Balinese spices and flowers, designed to relax and soothe your senses.', 847000, 'IDR', 2), ('Traditional Massage', 'Traditional Candidasa Body Massage (60 min)', 'A full-body powerful massage from Candidasa to release tension, realign senses and calm you down.', 847000, 'IDR', 3), ('Reflexology', 'Foot Reflexology (45 min)', 'We provide a combination of ancient Indonesian and Chinese acupressure techniques to relax your feet and improve blood circulation. Our traditional oil will warm and strengthen your foot muscles.', 302500, 'IDR', 0), ('Reflexology', 'Foot Reflexology (45 min)', 'Combination of ancient Indonesian and Chinese acupressure techniques to relax your feet and improve blood circulation.', 302500, 'IDR', 1), ('Foot Massage', 'Geringsing Foot & Shoulder Massage (45 min)', 'Pamper yourself with a rejuvenating treatment for relaxation, release of tension along with improvement on mental and emotional state. It involves applying pressure to the feet and shoulder to affect a physical change in the body.', 272250, 'IDR', 0), ('Foot Massage', 'Geringsing Foot & Shoulder Massage (45 min)', 'Rejuvenating treatmen